    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "code",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "```cpp\n#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    int a = 0, b = 0, cnt = 0;\n    cin >> a >> b;\n    for (int n = a; n <= b; n++) {\n    bool isPrime = true;\n    for (int i = 2; i * i <= n; i++) {\n    if (n % i == 0) {\n    isPrime = false;\n    break;\n    }\n    }\n    if (isPrime)\n    cnt++;\n    }\n    cout << cnt << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
